Rewrite: Reorganize the content for the current request
Grill-me: Add key details before generating the Prompt
Stop or ⌘.: Stop waiting and keep the original text

Content Actions
Open Template Center from the Templates menu
Save as New Template: Create a template, preview it, then save
Update Original Template: Confirm before replacing the source template
